PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787021263
OL,3,CRussia threatens consequences over
OL,4,C'use of UK drones in Ukraine deep
OL,5,Cstrikes'
OL,7,FRussia's embassy to the UK said in a
OL,8,Fstatement on Monday that the reports
OL,9,F"confirm that London is deliberately
OL,10,Fopting for an escalation of the
OL,11,FUkraine crisis" and accused Britain of
OL,12,F"seeking to contain Russia and inflict
OL,13,Fmaximum damage on it by proxy".
OL,15,F"London's actions will inevitably
OL,16,Fcarry consequences for which it will
OL,17,Fhave to answer," it added.
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@OO]tD@AOUuD@^O]wD@AOUyD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
