OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787021263
OL,3,CRussia threatens consequences over
OL,4,C'use of UK drones in Ukraine deep
OL,5,Cstrikes'
OL,7,F"The deeper its involvement in the
OL,8,Fconflict and the greater its support
OL,9,Ffor Kyiv's terrorist machinery, the
OL,10,Fhigher the price it will pay."
OL,12,FA Ministry of Defence spokesperson
OL,13,Fsaid: "Britain stands shoulder to
OL,14,Fshoulder with Ukraine and we are
OL,15,Fcommitted to providing the equipment
OL,16,FUkraine needs to defend itself against
OL,17,FPutin's illegal invasion.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@^O]uD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
