PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787021263
OL,3,CRussia threatens consequences over
OL,4,C'use of UK drones in Ukraine deep
OL,5,Cstrikes'
OL,7,FIt launched three times as many of
OL,8,Fthose strikes in July as it did in
OL,9,FJanuary, according to data from Acled,
OL,10,Fan independent conflict monitor.
OL,12,FRepeatedly hitting deep into Russia
OL,13,Fhas forced its military to stretch air
OL,14,Fdefences over a larger area.
OL,16,FRussia's Ministry of Defence said on
OL,17,FSaturday that it had shot down 598
OL,18,FUkrainian drones over 19 Russian
OL,19,Fregions, as well as the Black and Azov
OL,20,FSeas and the annexed Ukrainian
OL,21,Fpeninsula of Crimea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
